Description: Probability calibration in the 'mlr3' ecosystem. Provides a unified
    calibration PipeOp for 'mlr3pipelines', calibration measures for 'mlr3', and reliability plots
    for comparing calibrated and uncalibrated learners. Supports binary and multiclass
    calibration strategies such as Platt scaling, isotonic regression, beta calibration,
    and one-vs-rest wrappers, together with published calibration-error measures.
URL: https://github.com/giuseppec/mlr3calibration
